An '''oak birdhouse''' is a trap setup for [[bird house trapping]] on [[Fossil Island]]. An oak birdhouse is created by placing an [[oak bird house]] item on a [[bird house space]], which requires level 14 [[Hunter]]. 

To arm the trap, players must fill the birdhouse with 10 low level or 5 high level [[Hop seed|hop seeds]], [[herb seeds]], [[flower seeds]], [[bush seeds]], or [[allotment seeds]]. When filled with seeds, the oak birdhouse will passively fill with birds. After about 50 minutes, the oak birdhouse will be full and can be collected for [[bird nests]], [[raw bird meat]], and [[feathers]], as well as the [[clockwork]] used when crafting the item. Collecting the oak birdhouse awards 168 Hunter experience.

