===Other nests===
The nest table will be rolled 5 times. The chance of a successful roll is based on Hunter level, with more nests provided with a higher Hunter level{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1136339797952389122|date=5 June 2019|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/105093|archivedate=10 June 2021}}. The rate is constant at levels below 50.
